Third-party code built into Eclipse
-----------------------------------

The GameCube / Wii → RVZ converter (app/src/main/cpp) is Dolphin's disc code (Source/Core/DiscIO and the parts of
Source/Core/Common and Source/Core/Core/IOS it needs), from https://github.com/dolphin-emu/dolphin.
  Copyright 2003-2026 Dolphin Emulator Project. GPL-2.0-or-later (app/src/main/cpp/dolphin/COPYING).
  Files changed for Eclipse are marked "Eclipse" where they were changed.
With it, from Dolphin's Externals:
  - Zstandard: Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. BSD licence (externals/zstd/LICENSE).
  - {fmt}: Copyright (c) 2012 - present, Victor Zverovich. MIT licence (externals/fmt/LICENSE).
  - liblzma (XZ Utils): public domain / 0BSD (externals/liblzma/COPYING).
  - ZArchive (Xbox 360 .zar files): Copyright 2022 Exzap. MIT No Attribution (externals/zarchive/LICENSE).
  - Zstandard's seekable format (Azahar's Z3DS files), part of Zstandard: BSD licence.
  - Mbed TLS (AES, SHA-1, MD5 only): Copyright The Mbed TLS Contributors. Apache License 2.0
    (externals/mbedtls/LICENSE).

From Game Twin (https://github.com/alpha-minus/game-twin), Copyright 2026 Mert Aslantürk, GPL-3.0-or-later:
  - app/src/main/assets/companion/gamefaqs_catalog.json, strategywiki_catalog.json and vgmaps_catalog.json (game
    titles and the addresses of their guide and map pages), and the way titles are matched against them
    (data/GuideCatalogs.kt).
  - The idea and endpoint for achievement tips (RetroAchievements comments) and the checklist requests the Assistant
    is given (data/CompanionData.kt), adapted. Game Twin's name, logo and artwork are not used.

